#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendance_multi_rfid.field_hr_rfid_zone__attendance
msgid ""
"Enable automatic attendance tracking for this zone. When employees enter "
"this zone, they will be automatically checked in for attendance. When they "
"leave, they will be checked out. Perfect for main entrances or work areas."
